        "TileImage": "$($repository 5b5c9cd5-4f21-422b-828c-b41e8c777c2c).Image",
        "Description": "A group of anti-fish extremists are currently trying to empty Italy&apos;s oceans, one fish at a time. Someone going by the name &quot;King Neptune&quot; have hired you to stop them, and to let them sleep with the fishes as it were. Be careful 47, they are armed with fishing rods and extremely dangerous if they get their hooks in you.",
